    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having a nightmare with our jenkins pipeline. the unit test stage is being super flaky. it fails about 20% of the time but the codebase hasn't changed and the tests pass if i just retry the build. i've checked the basic stuff but i can't figure out what's causing these non-deterministic failures. any ideas on how to isolate the environment or what might be causing this?",
