      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To catch these intermittent failures in real time, enable distributed tracing or detailed logging in your CI pipeline that captures the full stack trace and system resource metrics (like CPU, memory, and I/O wait) at the exact moment of failure. You can also increase the resource limits allocated to your test containers slightly to eliminate timeouts caused by aggressive scheduling competition on shared runners. Investigate whether the randomness stems from non-deterministic seeds by adding explicit seed definitions to your test data generators, as this often masks environmental timing noise in batch processing.",
      "source": "target",
